## Missing-Chemical Impact and Preparation

Haitian-vetiver origin, Vertofix Coeur grade, literal cedar projection, and exact Exaltolide texture remain gaps. Current stocks cover this controlled direction; do not buy smoke, leather, oud, Kephalis, another amberwood, or another musk. Verify EB before mixing and keep every tincture excluded.

## Controlled Blinded Test Plan

Compare coded equal-mass, equal-concentration LN-06 and LN-01 in balanced order at 0, 5, and 30 minutes and 2 and 4 hours. Judge cardamom-lavender retention, cedar/vetiver legibility, vertical continuity, woody austerity or opacity, and liking. No physical result exists.

## Claim Ceiling

Physical liking, sensory similarity, stability, and measured headspace are `NOT TESTED`; safety and release are `NOT CLEARED`.

